  Placement: 1
  CardStory: "Weeks pass and many more companions return. Did they ever leave? Of
    course not. They weren't here yesterday. They\u2019ve never been here. *Yes they
    have.*\r\n\r\nBut then there seems to be very little in their eyes at all. *I
    think it\u2019s fine. Granted, 4Spade may not know much about herself, but she
    knows much about the order. All of them do, now.* 2Spade supposes that\u2019s
    what matters. *So do I. And their smiles are always ear to ear.* \r\n\r\n2Spade
    doesn\u2019t like it, for some reason. He\u2019s not sure why. But he\u2019s
    heard it say before. A smile from ear to ear. *So have I.*"
